357: 
358: - `.env.example`: add `MCP_AUTH_TOKEN=`, `MCP_APPROVE_SECRET=`, and note that remote transports require both (with the `openssl rand -hex 32` hint and "keep them distinct"). Keep the Cronometer credential lines.
