  6: [![CI](https://github.com/rwestergren/cronometer-api-mcp/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/rwestergren/cronometer-api-mcp/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
  7: [![Build Docker image](https://github.com/rwestergren/cronometer-api-mcp/actions/workflows/docker.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/rwestergren/cronometer-api-mcp/actions/workflows/docker.yml)
